OL,3,GNEWSAYour pictures: Sunny September
OL,4,
OL,5,FThere is a back to school feeling in
OL,6,Fthe air as we firmly enter
OL,7,Fmid-September.
OL,9,FWith an occasional chill in the air,
OL,10,Fthe nights may be drawing in earlier
OL,11,Fbut sunshine remains.
OL,13,FAs they are every week, our BBC weather
OL,14,Fwatchers have been out capturing the
OL,15,Fsunny skies.
OL,17,FHere are some of our favourite snaps.
